  "sourceTitle": "Monster Cookie Recipe",
  "sourceText": "Monster Cookie Recipe\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:10am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Brown sugar\n2 cups Sugar\n2 stk butter\n5 Eggs\n1 1/2 cups A/p flour\n4 teaspoons Baking soda\n1 cup Chocolate chips\n16 ounces Peanut butter\n4 cups Oats\n1 1/2 cups M&M's candy\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix butter, both sugars, and eggs together. Add baking soda, peanut butter, and flour. Mix well. Add remaining ingredients. Bake on a greased baking sheet at 325* for 7 - 9 minutes.",
